	"Description": "[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#D4D4D8]Removes trash from CinderSnap beach west. Removes wood piles from the beach and ginger island beach west. [/color]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#d4d4d8]Download the mod. Install same folder as other mods.\u00A0[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]\n<br />Removes trash from CinderSnap beach west. Removes wood piles from the beach and ginger island beach west. You can choose which areas you want. Does not open up town shortcuts.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Content Patcher[/color][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Shout outs[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#d4d4d8]Thank you everyone who has downloaded, endorsed and commented on my mods.\u00A0[/color]\n<br />[color=#d4d4d8]You can find all my mods here.[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[color=#d4d4d8][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/sadnumbme/mods]sadnumbme's Mods[/url][/color]\n<br />\n<br />Thanks everyone",
